  "description": "LOLHAZ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C80 H96 Dy8 N8 O40. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy7 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy8 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 8 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.622-3.884 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 92.37-117.35°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C80 H96 Dy8 N8 O40. Article name explicitly identifies I(II).",
